        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe abakulemberamu abandi nga muli batulu, musengeedha ensowera egwire mu maadhi ge muja okunhwa, aye ate mwamira engamiya enamba!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mukagwireku Abanamateeka n'Abafarisaayo, abakuusa imwe, ebikopo n'esowaani mubinhiriza ku ngulu ate nga munda mwidhwire bukambuzi na bya mulyakubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mufarisaayo iwe omutulu, sooka onaaze munda mu kikopo, memale onhirize ni ku ngulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mukagwireku Abanamateeka n'Abafarisaayo, abakuusa imwe, kuba mufaanana ng'amagombe ge basiizeeku langi endheru obulungi, nga gaboneka bulungi ku ngulu, aye nga munda gaidhwire magumba ga bafu na buli kivundu kyonakyona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.23.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bik 23:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutyo mwena bwe muli: Ku ngulu mufaanana ng'abantu abatuukirivu, aye munda mwidhwire buguya na budheemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mukagwireku Abanamateeka n'Abafarisaayo abakuusa imwe, kuba muzimba amagombe g'abalanzi, mwatimba ebiidhukizo eby'abatuukirivu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era mwakoba muti, ‘Nguli twaligho mu biseera bya badhaadha titwandyeyimbye nabo mu kuyugha musaayi gwa balanzi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale mutyo beene mwakakasa muti muli baana b'abo abaita abalanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni mumalirize badhaadha baimwe kye batoolera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Imwe emisota, abaana ab'emisota egy'obusagwa! Muliwona mutya okusalirwa omusango gwa geyeena?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 3:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 3:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ndidha kubatumira abalanzi, n'abasaadha abagezi n'abeegeresa abandi mulibaita, mwabakomerera ku misalaba, abandi mulibakuba enkoba mu sinagoga dhaimwe, era mwabakiriga mu buli kibuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ni mulibaaku omusango olw'omusaayi ogw'abatuufu ogwayuyibwa mu nsi, okuva ku musaayi gwa Abeli ataali na musango okutuuka ku musaayi gwa Zekaria omwana wa Berakia ye mwaitira ghagati gh'eisinzizo n'alutaari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 4:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.24.20+2CH.24.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Byom 24:20-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwenebwene, ka mbakobere: Bino byonabyona biribaagho ku bantu ab'oluse luno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
